{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e74afb6-7282-89e1-a66b-2b0e032f478a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T11:31:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:29:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. I've got a couch I need to get rid of. Hmm, well, a couch and maybe a chair, let me see. Actually just the couch. How do I put that out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a couch. That would be a bulk item, so it isn't picked up with your regular trash. Is it going out to the curb at your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the curb. I'm a homeowner. I figured I'd just set it out Monday, or, no, wait, I don't know what day my trash is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Generally bulk items need to be arranged ahead of time, so you wouldn't want to just leave it out. Let me make sure I have this right, you have one couch, and you want it picked up from the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, one couch. It's fabric, not leather, if that matters. Hmm, I don't think it matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It might, actually, depending on how they handle it. I don't have the details of the schedule in front of me for bulk pickups, so I'd rather have a supervisor get back to you with the right answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes, that would be good. Can a supervisor call me back? Because I got a little confused on the website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I can put in the request. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0181. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0181. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lucille Barone. B-A-R-O-N-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lucille Barone, got it. I'll note it's about pickup of one fabric couch from the curb, and that you'd like a call back from a supervisor. Is there a time of day that's better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:30:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, anytime today is fine, I'm home. Oh, hold on, I have a casserole in the oven that needs ten more minutes, so I might have to step away if they call right now. But I'll hear the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. If you miss it, they can leave a message. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Hmm, no, that's everything. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Barone. Someone will call you back. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
